# Project Structure Rules

- Backend: `travel_agent_backend/` (FastAPI app, agent tools, LLM interface, FAISS RAG, SQL models)
- Frontend: `travel_agent_flutter/` (GetX feature modules: controllers, views, bindings for home, assistant, flights, booking, agent_trace)
- Always place API endpoints in `app/api/` and agent tools in `app/agent/tools/`.
